        "Content": "<ul><li> First-floor two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment </li><li> Approximately 64 sq m / 689 sq ft </li><li> Designated car-parking space </li><li> Two double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes </li><li> Private balcony off the living and dining room </li><li> Central Chapelizod village location </li><li> Phoenix Park and River Liffey nearby </li><li> Annual management fee of 2,729, with monthly payment option</li></ul>"
